              "text": "To log into your Microsoft account, choose the option below that fits your account type:\n\n### 1. Personal Microsoft Account\n*(For Outlook.com, Hotmail, Xbox, OneDrive, Skype, or personal Microsoft 365 subscriptions)*\n*   **Sign-In Page:** [account.microsoft.com](https://account.microsoft.com)\n*   **Direct Login Portal:** [login.live.com](https://login.live.com)\n\n### 2. Work or School Account\n*(For organization-provided Microsoft 365, Teams, Azure, or school email accounts)*\n*   **Sign-In Page:** [myaccount.microsoft.com](https://myaccount.microsoft.com)\n*   **Direct Login Portal:** [login.microsoftonline.com](https://login.microsoftonline.com)\n\n---\n\n### Need Help Signing In?\n*   **Forgot your password?** You can reset it by going to the [Microsoft Password Reset page](https://account.live.com/ResetPassword.aspx).\n*   **Forgot your username/email?** Go to [Recover your username](https://account.live.com/username/recover) and enter an associated phone number or alternative email.\n*   **Security Tip:** Always verify that the address bar in your browser starts with `https://login.microsoftonline.com`, `https://login.live.com`, or `https://account.microsoft.com` before typing in your password to protect yourself from phishing attempts.",
